ODW8502 `_check_recursion` was removed in Odoo 20.0 (deprecated since 18.0). Use `not _has_cycle(...)` instead — the result is inverted.
  --> deprecated_odoo_method_call.py:12:14
   |
10 |         self._filter_access_rules("read")
11 |         self._filter_access_rules_python("read")
12 |         self._check_recursion()
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
13 |         self._check_m2m_recursion("child_ids")
   |

