ODW8502 `check_field_access_rights` was removed in Odoo 20.0 (deprecated since 19.0). Use `check_field_access` (`_check_field_access` before 20.0), or `fields_get` to list the allowed fields.
  --> deprecated_odoo_method_call.py:17:14
   |
15 |     def deprecated_in_19(self):
16 |         self.read_group([], ["amount:sum"], ["partner_id"])
17 |         self.check_field_access_rights("read", ["name"])
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
18 |         self.env["my.model"].browse(1).toggle_active()
   |

