ODW8502 `read_group` was replaced in Odoo 20.0: the name is back as the RPC adapter over `_read_group`, whose signature has no `lazy`, so this is still the pre-20.0 API. Use `_read_group` in backend code, or `formatted_read_group` for a formatted result.
  --> deprecated_odoo_method_call.py:53:21
   |
51 |     def with_lazy(self):
52 |         # `lazy` is not in the 20.0 signature, so this is unambiguously the pre-20.0 API.
53 |         return self.read_group([], ["amount:sum"], ["partner_id"], lazy=False)
   |                     ^^^^^^^^^^
